This version (V3) of the WASA Fast GUN is based on WASA_Fast_V4. The SEC geometry is read from a GDML (same as in version WASA_Fast_V3), and the TPC is included in WASADetectorConstruction.
The followig codes were transfered from WASA_Fast_Gun_V2 to this version:

+ WASAPrimaryGeneratorAction (cc and hh)
+ WASAPrimaryGeneratorMessenger (cc and hh)

Important note:
The cut on KE in WASAFastSimModelTracke.cc was alteread to 1 MeV (to avoide crash when Ion energies were too low):
   G4double KE = aFastTrack.GetPrimaryTrack()->GetKineticEnergy()/MeV;
   if (KE < 1.0 ) {
     aFastStep.KillPrimaryTrack();
     return;
   }

The file CMakeLists.txt from WASA_Fast_V4 was altered to copy to the build directory the following files:
filtered_barrel.gdml wasa_simulation_signal.in vis_wasa.mac verify_output.C




